   4.0031505537829227`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"761dd40c-aa5e-9e49-ac61-\
7d0d9fa16e04"],

Cell["\<\
Explore how amplitude, angular frequency, and phase affect a sinusoidal \
function, progressing from a static plot to interactive controls.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.98412909308037*^9, {3.984131851616743*^9, 3.9841318678448677`*^9}, {
   4.003150149278818*^9, 4.00315015028953*^9}, 
   4.0031504270068455`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"e017b114-0210-ae4a-8fec-\
de145d266b39"],

