\[Dash]spring system, Euler\[CloseCurlyQuote]s collinear solutions, Lagrange\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s equilateral-triangle solutions, and a 4:3 resonant orbit \
in the Earth\[Dash]Moon system.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0031518493780937`*^9, 4.0031518520559845`*^9}, 
