Cell[TextData[{
 ButtonBox["Wolfram U",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://www.wolfram.com/wolfram-u/"], None},
  ButtonNote->"https://www.wolfram.com/wolfram-u/"],
 " offers learning resources across programming, mathematics, physics, data \
science, AI, visualization, and modeling. Formats include interactive \
courses, instructor-led training, webinars, video lessons, and study groups. \
I particularly recommend interactive courses for self-paced learning with \
videos, computational notebooks, exercises, and assessments. Four types of \
certificates and certifications are available: Attendance, confirming \
participation; Completion, confirming completion of course or program \
requirements; Level 1 Proficiency, demonstrating competency through \
assessments such as timed exams; and Level 2 Applied Expertise, demonstrating \
practical skills through an independently assessed project. The following \
recommendations cover courses and certifications in programming, data \
science, machine learning, and mathematics, with particular attention to the \
mathematical foundations that support programming and machine learning."
